{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTremolo\/color"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"color"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLColor","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLColor","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL10MXLTremoloV5colorAA8MXLColorVSgvp","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"color"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLColor","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"symbolKind":"property","title":"color"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTremolo"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The color attribute group indicates the color of an element."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltremolo\/color"]}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLTremolo/color":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The color attribute group indicates the color of an element."}],"title":"color","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTremolo\/color","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltremolo\/color","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"color","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLColor","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLTremolo":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The tremolo ornament can be used to indicate single-note, double-note, or unmeasured tremolos. Single-note"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tremolos use the single type, double-note tremolos use the start and stop types, and unmeasured tremolos use"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the unmeasured type. The default is “single” for compatibility with Version 1.1. The text of the element"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"indicates the number of tremolo marks and is an integer from 0 to 8. Note that the number of attached beams is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not included in this value, but is represented separately using the beam element. The value should be 0 for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unmeasured tremolos."}],"title":"MXLTremolo","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLTremolo","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLTremolo","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltremolo","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTremolo"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLColor":{"abstract":[{"text":"The color type indicates the color of an element. Color may be represented as hexadecimal RGB triples, as in","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"HTML, or as hexadecimal ARGB tuples, with the A indicating alpha of transparency. An alpha value of 00 is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"totally transparent; FF is totally opaque. If RGB is used, the A value is assumed to be FF.","type":"text"}],"title":"MXLColor","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLColor"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLColor"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlcolor","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLColor"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","type":"topic","role":"collection"}}}